* uVCO oscillator-core simulation models.
* Manufacturer model text is retained with its source attribution.

* Source: https://www.diodes.com/spice/download/3320/DMMT3904W.spice.txt
*SRC=DMMT3904W;DI_DMMT3904W;BJTs NPN; Si;  40.0V  0.200A  347MHz   Diodes
*Inc. Matched Transistor
.MODEL DI_DMMT3904W NPN (IS=20.3f NF=1.00 BF=274 VAF=114
+ IKF=36.4m ISE=6.99p NE=2.00 BR=4.00 NR=1.00
+ VAR=24.0 IKR=90.0m RE=0.657 RB=2.63 RC=0.263
+ XTB=1.5 CJE=8.29p VJE=1.10 MJE=0.500 CJC=7.10p VJC=0.300
+ MJC=0.300 TF=426p TR=71.3n EG=1.12 )

* Physical DMMT3904W package order used by the KiCad symbol:
* 1=B1, 2=B2, 3=C2, 4=C1, 5=E1, 6=E2.
.SUBCKT DMMT3904W_PAIR B1 B2 C2 C1 E1 E2
QA C1 B1 E1 DI_DMMT3904W
QB C2 B2 E2 DI_DMMT3904W
.ENDS DMMT3904W_PAIR

* Source: https://www.diodes.com/spice/download/1941/2N7002.spice.txt
.SUBCKT N7002 10 20 30
* TERMINALS: D G S
M1 1 2 3 3 NMOS L=1E-006 W=1E-006
RD 10 1 0.976
RS 30 3 0.001
RG 20 2 160.6
CGS 2 3 2E-011
EGD 12 0 2 1 1
VFB 14 0 0
FFB 2 1 VFB 1
CGD 13 14 5.9E-011
R1 13 0 1
D1 12 13 DLIM
DDG 15 14 DCGD
R2 12 15 1
D2 15 0 DLIM
DSD 3 10 DSUB
.MODEL NMOS NMOS LEVEL=3 VMAX=1E+006 ETA=0 VTO=2.154
+ TOX=6E-008 NSUB=1E+016 KP=0.4654 KAPPA=1E-015 U0=400
.MODEL DCGD D CJO=1.2E-011 VJ=0.6 M=0.6
.MODEL DSUB D IS=6.808E-010 N=1.576 RS=0.1408 BV=72 CJO=8E-012 VJ=0.8 M=0.6474
.MODEL DLIM D IS=0.0001
.ENDS N7002

.SUBCKT N7002_KICAD D G S
XCORE D G S N7002
.ENDS N7002_KICAD

* Datasheet-bounded TPA1862 single-channel approximation.
* Pin order: OUT IN+ IN- V+ V-.  A0 is 120 dB and GBW is 6 MHz.
* The 16.5 MHz second pole gives about 70 degrees phase margin at unity gain,
* matching the datasheet condition of RL=10k and CL=100pF.  Slew current is
* selected for 5 V/us at the dominant-pole capacitor.
.SUBCKT TPA1862_CH OUT INP INN VPLUS VMINUS PARAMS: VOS=0 A0=1e6 GBW=6e6 SR=5e6 ROUT=20 P2=16.5e6
.PARAM GM=1 RDOM={A0/GM} CDOM={GM/(6.283185307179586*GBW)} ISLEW={CDOM*SR} RP2=1k CP2={1/(6.283185307179586*P2*RP2)}
RINP INP 0 10T
RINN INN 0 10T
GERR 0 NPOLE VALUE={MIN(ISLEW,MAX(-ISLEW,GM*(V(INP)-V(INN)+VOS)))}
RDOM NPOLE 0 {RDOM}
CDOM NPOLE 0 {CDOM}
DCLAMP_HI NPOLE VPLUS DCLAMP
DCLAMP_LO VMINUS NPOLE DCLAMP
RP2 NPOLE NPOLE2 {RP2}
CP2 NPOLE2 0 {CP2}
BCLIP NDRIVE 0 V={MIN(V(VPLUS)-15m,MAX(V(VMINUS)+3m,V(NPOLE2)))}
ROUT NDRIVE OUT {ROUT}
COUT OUT 0 10p
.MODEL DCLAMP D(IS=1e-12 N=1 RS=1)
.ENDS TPA1862_CH

* Physical SOP-8 order used by TPA1862-SR:
* 1=OUTA, 2=INA-, 3=INA+, 4=V-, 5=INB+, 6=INB-, 7=OUTB, 8=V+.
.SUBCKT TPA1862_DUAL OUTA INNA INPA VMINUS INPB INNB OUTB VPLUS
XA OUTA INPA INNA VPLUS VMINUS TPA1862_CH
XB OUTB INPB INNB VPLUS VMINUS TPA1862_CH
.ENDS TPA1862_DUAL

* Datasheet-bounded TP1961 comparator approximation.
* Pin order: OUT IN+ IN- V+ V-.  Internal positive feedback gives 7.5 mV
* nominal hysteresis at a 5 V supply.  RDEL/CDEL approximate 7 ns delay.
.SUBCKT TP1961 OUT INP INN VPLUS VMINUS PARAMS: VOS=2m VHYST=7.5m TPD=7n ROUT=25
.PARAM VSPAN={5} KHYST={VHYST/VSPAN}
RINP INP 0 100G
RINN INN 0 100G
BSTATE NLOGIC 0 V={V(VMINUS)+(V(VPLUS)-V(VMINUS))*(0.5+0.5*TANH(1500*(V(INP)-V(INN)+VOS+KHYST*(V(NSTATE)-(V(VPLUS)+V(VMINUS))/2))))}
RDEL NLOGIC NSTATE 1k
CDEL NSTATE 0 {TPD/1k}
BCLIP NDRIVE 0 V={MIN(V(VPLUS)-1m,MAX(V(VMINUS)+1m,V(NSTATE)))}
ROUT NDRIVE OUT {ROUT}
COUT OUT 0 10p
.ENDS TP1961

* Physical SOT-23-5 order: 1=OUT, 2=V-, 3=IN+, 4=IN-, 5=V+.
.SUBCKT TP1961_5PIN OUT VMINUS INP INN VPLUS
XCOMP OUT INP INN VPLUS VMINUS TP1961
.ENDS TP1961_5PIN

* Simulation values for physical adjustable/temperature-sensitive parts.
.SUBCKT RTRIM_TUNED P N
RVALUE P N 25.57k
.ENDS RTRIM_TUNED

.SUBCKT PTC_10K_3300 P N
RVALUE P N 10k tc1=0.0033
.ENDS PTC_10K_3300

* TL072 output-level channel approximation used only after the timing core.
* Pin order: OUT IN+ IN- V+ V-.  Typical 3 MHz GBW and 13 V/us slew rate.
.SUBCKT TL072_CH OUT INP INN VPLUS VMINUS PARAMS: VOS=0 A0=2e5 GBW=3e6 SR=13e6 ROUT=100
.PARAM GM=1 RDOM={A0/GM} CDOM={GM/(6.283185307179586*GBW)} ISLEW={CDOM*SR}
RINP INP 0 1T
RINN INN 0 1T
GERR 0 NPOLE VALUE={MIN(ISLEW,MAX(-ISLEW,GM*(V(INP)-V(INN)+VOS)))}
RDOM NPOLE 0 {RDOM}
CDOM NPOLE 0 {CDOM}
DCLAMP_HI NPOLE VPLUS DCLAMP_TL
DCLAMP_LO VMINUS NPOLE DCLAMP_TL
BCLIP NDRIVE 0 V={MIN(V(VPLUS)-1.5,MAX(V(VMINUS)+1.5,V(NPOLE)))}
ROUT NDRIVE OUT {ROUT}
COUT OUT 0 10p
.MODEL DCLAMP_TL D(IS=1e-12 N=1 RS=1)
.ENDS TL072_CH

* Physical dual-package order: 1=OUTA, 2=INA-, 3=INA+, 4=V-,
* 5=INB+, 6=INB-, 7=OUTB, 8=V+.
.SUBCKT TL072_DUAL OUTA INNA INPA VMINUS INPB INNB OUTB VPLUS
XA OUTA INPA INNA VPLUS VMINUS TL072_CH
XB OUTB INPB INNB VPLUS VMINUS TL072_CH
.ENDS TL072_DUAL
